<title>UK: ABN AMRO sets call warrants on BIC.</title>
<headline>ABN AMRO sets call warrants on BIC.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-02-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>ABN AMRO Hoare Govett has issued 800,000 American-style call warrants, on BIC, lead manager ABN AMRO Finance SA said.</p>
<p>10 warrants control one share.</p>
<p> STRIKE PRICE    1,050.00 FRF	    PREMIUM	=</p>
<p> ISSUE PRICE     15.81 FRF		 GEARING	5.86 TIMES</p>
<p> EXERCISE PERIOD 24.MAR.97-30.MAR.99   PAYDATE	21.MAR.97</p>
<p> LISTING	   PARIS		     MIN EXER LOT 1000</p>
</text>
